      strategies: ["Link the factors", "Ask “who benefits?”", "Compare case studies"],
      thinkDeeper:
        "Hindenburg had beaten Hitler in the presidential election of April 1932. Less than ten months later he appointed the man he had defeated. What does this suggest about whether Hitler 'seized' power or was 'given' it?",
